<section id="contatti">
  <div class="container">
    <div class="section-header">
      <h2 class="section-title">Connettiamoci!</h2>
      <p class="section-subtitle">Diamo vita a grandi idee!</p>
    </div>
    <div class="contact-container">
      <div class="contact-text">
        <p>
          Se anche tu credi in un modo di lavorare in cui tecnologia, curiosità e valori umani convivono, mi farà piacere conoscerti.
        </p>
        <div class="contact-methods">
          <div class="method">
            <strong>Email</strong>
            <a href="mailto:sara.romano.15@gmail.com">sara.romano.15@gmail.com</a>
          </div>
          <div class="method">
            <strong>Telefono</strong>
            <a href="tel:+393273921925">+39 327 392 1925</a>
          </div>
          <div class="method">
            <strong>Social</strong>
            <div class="social-links">
              <a href="https://www.linkedin.com/in/sara-romano-1368591b7" target="_blank">LinkedIn</a>
              <a href="https://www.instagram.com/rasa_noma/" target="_blank">Instagram</a>
              <a href="https://www.facebook.com/sara.romano.503/" target="_blank">Facebook</a>
              <a href="https://github.com/sararom15" target="_blank">GitHub</a>
            </div>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

<style>
  .contact-container {
    max-width: 800px;
    margin: 0 auto;
    text-align: center;
  }

  .highlight {
    color: var(--color-primary);
  }

  .contact-text p {
    font-size: 1.25rem;
    color: var(--color-text-muted);
    margin: 0 auto 3rem auto;
    line-height: 1.6;
    max-width: 600px;
  }

  .contact-methods {
    display: flex;
    flex-direction: column;
    gap: 2rem;
    align-items: center;
  }

  .method {
    display: flex;
    flex-direction: column;
    align-items: center;
    gap: 0.5rem;
  }

  .method strong {
    display: block;
    font-size: 0.9rem;
    text-transform: uppercase;
    color: var(--color-text-muted);
    letter-spacing: 1px;
  }

  .method a {
    font-size: 1.5rem;
    font-weight: 500;
    color: var(--color-text);
    text-decoration: none;
    transition: color 0.3s ease;
  }

  .method a:hover {
    color: var(--color-primary);
  }

  .social-links {
    display: flex;
    gap: 2rem;
    flex-wrap: wrap;
    justify-content: center;
  }
  
  .social-links a {
    font-size: 1.1rem;
    border-bottom: 1px solid transparent;
  }

  .social-links a:hover {
    border-bottom-color: var(--color-primary);
  }
</style>
